Overview [#over]
****************

The Pyschrometrics extension provides a set of functions for basic
[psychrometric]`http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychrometrics` and related
calculations implemented in Axon. Credit goes to Eric Kozubal for providing the
Microsoft Excel VBA macros originally used to create this extension.

The `psychSolver()` function is a flexible "one stop shop" for calculating most
pyschrometric properties supported by this extension. (Thank you to James Donson
for the inspiration for and initial implementation of this function.) Other,
lower-level functions calculate specific properties of moist air, liquid water,
and glycol-water mixtures. The functions are individually documented.

See also the [psychrometricsExt]`https://github.com/NREL/psychrometricsExt/`
repository on GitHub for a change log.